Keep Track of Call Stack
        Leverage the language's implicit runtime stack (via recursion) to 
        freeze current execution states and automatically resume them upon backtracking
        
Passing Variable
        Send state arguments downward through recursive parameters to dictate context or 
        constraints to deeper child nodes (e.g., path so far, current sum).
        
Global Variable
        Maintain an external, persistent tracker to record a global optimum across disparate recursive paths 
        that do not share a direct parent-child return relationship
        
Revisiting
        Employ a tracking mechanism (like a hash set, boolean array, or in-place modification) 
        to intercept and block processing of previously evaluated states, avoiding infinite loops
